+.. change:
+    :tags: bug, sqlite
+    :tickets: 4099
+    :versions: 1.2.0b3
+
+    Fixed bug where SQLite CHECK constraint reflection would fail
+    if the referenced table were in a remote schema, e.g. on SQLite a
+    remote database referred to by ATTACH.
